cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this dataset or toolchain supports your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Philippine Barangay Boundaries GeoJSON with PSGC Codes and RDF Change History"
abstract: >-
  Enriched Philippine administrative boundaries (barangay, municipality, city, province, region)
  as GeoJSON, with each polygon annotated with its canonical Philippine Standard Geographic Code
  (PSGC). Derived from PSA PSGC snapshots and NAMRIA administrative-boundary shapefiles
  (v2023-11-06). Includes a quarterly PSGC change history published as W3C ORG RDF linked data
  across 17 snapshots (2021-08-19 to 2026-04-13).
